yed-population impact.", "Clinical SHACL nonconformance requires human review."], "rationale": "The incident narrative describes a confirmed failure to detect ventricular fibrillation (VF), which is a life-threatening arrhythmia requiring immediate intervention. The event was not contained by an automatic control; instead, the device failed its primary safety function in real-time use. Crucially, the narrative confirms recurrence across the deployed population ('a second... miss was confirmed in a separate patient on the same software version'), establishing broad exposure to serious risk. This meets the criteria for Severity 4 (realized serious harm potential with recurrent impact) and mandates immediate Field Safety Corrective Action per regulatory obligations regarding post-market surveillance of safety-critical failures.", "recommendation": "ESCALATE_TO_HUMAN_IMMEDIATE", "requires_human_review": true, "severity": 4}, "final_report_sha256": "6b655f5029ba6f7919cc736e061e64878dfaf1decee8b0ece4e620e885b14411", "generation_source": "ollama_real", "invalid_proposals": 1, "is_fallback": false, "is_mock": false, "opa_actions": ["fsca_without_confirmatory_evidence_downgraded", "severity4_or_death_forced_immediate_human_escalation", "technical_incident_missing_technical_evidence", "deny:technical_incident_missing_technical_evidence", "clinical_shacl_nonconformance_routes_review"], "recommendation": "ESCALATE_TO_HUMAN_IMMEDIATE", "record_type": "terminal", "report_id": "SYN-IND-0026", "retrievals": 1, "revisions": 1, "run_id": "inloop_SYN-IND-0026_cb4e44a7", "scenario_id": "SYN-IND-0026", "schema_version": "2.1.0", "severity": 4, "shacl_findings": [{"message": "RiskReport must link at least one evidence id.", "severity": "Severity: sh:Violation", "shape": "shacl"}], "state_terminal": "terminal", "termination_reason": "human escalation or invalid transition", "timestamp_utc": "2026-08-06T08:50:40.393446Z", "total_steps": 5, "trace_id": "fe8eba72-578f-4964-bb86-1ad3c5a3c934"